  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO/CEEC MOST Inception Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cuba faces increasing economic, social, and governance challenges that require anticipatory, evidence based decision making. Currently, there is limited institutional use of futures literacy and structured methodologies to analyze change and design innovative public responses. The CFLL pilotinception phase addresses this gap by introducing the UNESCO MOST methodology and establishing a permanent multi actor platform for foresight, innovation, and policy dialogue</narrative>
  </description>
